  "integrationNote": "Incoming71b039ae860c45e982dfbc8b1f401143d49d2454 changes no authorized product/test path. Root will preserve its media, workflow and ledger changes serially; shipping App source bindings must be reconciled to its main.rs before freeze.",
  "decisions": [
    {
      "id": "DFA-DEC-01",
      "decision": "FIX",
      "rationale": "Actual fresh bearer issuance omits existing approved role/grant checks while ordinary operator commands bypass retained validation. Reuse a private connection-taking form of the same owner validator before issuing a proof, preserving the lock and all later admission checks."
    },
    {
      "id": "DFA-DEC-02",
      "decision": "ADOPT",
      "rationale": "Fresh lookup maps only typed Unauthorized to Ok(None), consistent with its existing unknown/revoked semantics. Matched malformed or unreadable decisive authority remains fixed Internal500. Public retained validation is unchanged."
    },
    {
      "id": "DFA-ORACLE-01",
      "decision": "ADOPT",
      "rationale": "Existing App shipping controls execute real owner/helpers plus mutation-sensitive source bindings; no full UnifiedGatewayApi constructor fixture was found. Specify actual TCP Gateway + App settings-dispatch helper + real Settings state, separately recorded shipping source bindings and App compilation. Do not claim full App construction or packaged E2E. This resolves an unimplemented oracle wording mismatch before code; no existing assertion is deleted or weakened."
    },
    {
      "id": "DFA-ORACLE-02",
      "decision": "ADOPT",
      "rationale": "Retain decisive late-admission negatives by capturing genuine proofs before authority withdrawal/corruption in the same owner. After reopen never substitute a foreign old-owner proof; recapture under valid state then invalidate, or assert fresh refusal directly. Preserve exact bytes and late owner assertions; explicitly test the one unselected invalid grant in the DPA empty-baseline case."
    },
    {
      "id": "DFA-STR-PERF-01",
      "finding": "STR-PERF-01",
      "severity": "P2",
      "decision": "FIX",
      "classification": "IMPL_BUG",
      "beforeImplementation": true,
      "rationale": "Fresh authentication newly invokes the existing complete-grant validator under the shared pairing mutex. Its three membership passes each linearly scan a full vector, giving quadratic source-derived work for large valid grants. Preserve all authority and error semantics while using local membership sets and the existing role_scope_policy_allows helper; no persistent cache, new owner, incompatible scope cap or weakening.",
      "contractAmendment": "DFA-09 before code: local lookup sets, literal spelling/operator implication preservation, large-grant fresh/retained/HTTP positives and tail-overgrant refusals with full raw-state and Settings oracles; no timing-threshold or measured-performance claim.",
      "reviewRequirement": "Fresh blind R3 pair over original twelve-path frozen scope plus focused delta; exact-H Actions required."
    },
    {
      "id": "DFA-STR-PERF-02",
      "origin": "root adjacent-source finding independently confirmed by R3 structure reviewer",
      "severity": "P2",
      "decision": "FIX",
      "classification": "IMPL_BUG",
      "beforeImplementation": true,
      "rationale": "Fresh current_pairing_record newly parses approved roles through normalized_authority_strings, whose Vec-based dedup scans all previously seen roles. Real pair requests persist unbounded role arrays and trusted approval retains them; 20000 distinct roles cause N(N-1)/2 equality attempts in this parser under the fresh authentication lock. Source-derived complexity only, not measured timing.",
      "fix": "Build one local borrowed BTreeSet while retaining first-seen Vec, Rust str::trim, empty filtering and strict full-array string validation. Preserve role spelling/order and management callers. Extend owner/HTTP large-authority controls with valid large role arrays, invalid final non-string refusal, full unchanged state and repair/reopen.",
      "reviewRequirement": "DFA-10 contract before code, original12path R4 focused fresh pair and exact-H Actions. No scope cap/new owner/cache.",
      "independentFinding": "R3-STR-001",
      "implementation": "Applied local seen BTreeSet and large role/malformed-tail owner+HTTP controls; pending immutable R4/source/execution"
    }
  ],
